# Copy to .env in this directory (gitignored)
# Leave SURREAL_URL unset (or empty) and Ganda starts SurrealDB in Docker
# (`SURREAL_IMAGE`, default surrealdb/surrealdb:v3.3.4, the build the probe verified).

# Attach to a SurrealDB you already run instead of Docker (its HTTP address). Start it
# with `SURREAL_HTTP_MAX_SQL_BODY_SIZE="64 MiB"` (the default caps a /sql request at
# 1 MiB; `engine/limits.py` sends up to the declared bound):
# SURREAL_URL=http://localhost:8000
# SURREAL_USER=root
# SURREAL_PASSWORD=root
